The native libraries (libijkplayer.so) link against FFmpeg built without
--enable-gpl and without --enable-nonfree, i.e. FFmpeg under the GNU Lesser
General Public License v2.1 or later. FFmpeg source, build configuration and
the exact build scripts are published at:

  https://github.com/debugly/fsplayer  (FFToolChain submodule)
  https://github.com/debugly/MRFFToolChainBuildShell

The libraries are loaded dynamically (System.loadLibrary), so an application
that uses them can be relinked against a modified version of the library, as
required by section 6 of the LGPL.
